    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022control-header\u0022 aria-hidden=\u0022false\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022controls\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022umb-property-editor db\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022umb-property-editor umb-rte --initialized\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022umb-rte-editor-con\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe\u2019re proud to introduce Roadlab Rock Mechanics,\u0026nbsp;a state-of-the-art facility dedicated to the testing and analysis of rock and geological materials.\u0026nbsp;\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur new lab combines expert knowledge with advanced equipment to deliver accurate, reliable results for the mining, geotechnical, civil, and construction industries.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cem\u003EX-Ray Diffraction\u0026nbsp; | \u0026nbsp;Uniaxial Compressive Strength\u0026nbsp; | \u0026nbsp;Point Load \u003C/em\u003E\u003Cem\u003E\u0026nbsp;| \u0026nbsp;Slake Durability\u0026nbsp;\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E"
}]]></Value>
