    <heroSmallHeading>
      <Value><![CDATA[Welcome to Roadlab]]></Value>
    </heroSmallHeading>
    <oGDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[We’re proud to introduce Roadlab Rock Mechanics, a state-of-the-art facility dedicated to the testing and analysis of rock and geological materials. ]]></Value>
    </oGDescription>
    <oGImage>
      <Value><![CDATA[]]></Value>
    </oGImage>
